OL,3,CMan injured after shark attack in Co
OL,4,CWaterford
OL,6,FA man has been injured following a
OL,7,Fshark attack in Co Waterford.
OL,9,FA spokesperson from the Department of
OL,10,FTransport said: "At approximately
OL,11,F4.15pm yesterday the Irish Coast
OL,12,FGuard's Marine Rescue Co-ordination
OL,13,FCentre (MRCC) in Dublin were alerted
OL,14,Fby a 999/112 call to an incident on
OL,15,Fboard a small fishing vessel south of
OL,16,FArdmore, Co. Waterford.
OL,18,F"The report was that a male on board
OL,19,Fthe fishing vessel had a leg injury
OL,20,Finflicted by a bite from a shark.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/2
