OL,3,CMan injured after shark attack in Co
OL,4,CWaterford
OL,6,F"The Coast Guard's Waterford based
OL,7,Fhelicopter, Rescue 117, was tasked to
OL,8,Fthe scene as well as the Ballycotton
OL,9,FRNLI all weather lifeboat and the
OL,10,FYoughal RNLI inshore lifeboat.
OL,12,F"The male casualty was winched on
OL,13,Fboard on Rescue 117 and taken to Cork
OL,14,Funiversity hospital and handed over
OL,15,Finto the care of the HSE."
